@base <https://ontoboard.org/patterns/pmdco-scalar-value-specification.owl> .

<https://ontoboard.org/patterns/pmdco-scalar-value-specification.owl> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                                                                       dcterms:description "Represents scalar physical quantities by combining a numerical value and a unit. A scalar value specification carries has specified numeric value plus a measurement unit label, and is attached to a specifically dependent continuant through specified by value. Units are drawn from UO or QUDT."^^xsd:string ;
                                                                       dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> ;
                                                                       dcterms:title "Scalar value specification"^^xsd:string ;
                                                                       rdfs:comment """Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK's quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label added x7; term declared x3;
- header: dcterms:title \"Scalar value specification\" - the library's name for the pattern
- header: dcterms:description - the library's description of the pattern
- header: dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> - https://github.com/materialdigital/core-ontology
Each change is listed under \"curated\" in the pattern's metadata.json in OntoBoard's pattern library."""@en .

